!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/schema/invalid/a-parametric-record-over-a-container-constructor-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/schema-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.10, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.3"
  description: """
    A parametric record's body is a record body: braces or a composition. Only `meta.record` carries
    `parameters`, so a parameter list before a construction of `meta.array` is refused at the declaration, whether
    or not anything applies it. The application is written where it is used, `meta.array<T>` or `[T]`, or a
    construction is left open and completed where it is used, `nonempty => !meta.array ^ { min_items: 1 }` then
    `nonempty<T>`.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
